00:34:00.670 --> 00:34:07.070
Our master Franklin was a real fanatic, hysterical puritanism, you know. Terrible thing.

00:34:08.910 --> 00:34:10.550
What about our mistress Jessop?

00:34:13.040 --> 00:34:24.510
The usual method of trial, it seems, was by water, even though trial by ordeal had been illegal for centuries.

00:34:25.080 --> 00:34:29.840
But the witch finders claimed that Satan's disciples did not deserve fair trial.

00:34:30.350 --> 00:34:31.110
So they drowned them?

00:34:31.820 --> 00:34:33.180
Only the innocent ones.

00:34:33.440 --> 00:34:34.520
And the others they burned alive?

00:34:34.720 --> 00:34:35.680
Not always alive.

00:34:36.040 --> 00:34:38.660
Sometimes they strangled them first with a rope.

00:34:39.110 --> 00:34:40.570
I suppose they thought that was being merciful.

00:34:40.790 --> 00:34:41.270
No doubt.

00:34:41.770 --> 00:34:43.350
Ah, here we are.

00:34:44.070 --> 00:34:44.550
1652.

00:34:45.000 --> 00:34:46.660
There were several trials that year.

00:34:46.860 --> 00:34:47.360
May I see?

00:34:48.710 --> 00:34:50.430
One poor woman managed to escape.

00:34:50.890 --> 00:34:53.070
They raised a hue and cry but never found her.

00:34:53.170 --> 00:34:53.370
Where?

00:34:53.730 --> 00:34:54.010
There.

00:34:54.720 --> 00:34:56.160
Mistress Lucinda Jessop.

00:34:57.410 --> 00:34:58.510
Of Woodstock Farm.

00:35:08.880 --> 00:35:10.780
Come back here to me, David Winter.

00:35:14.200 --> 00:35:15.720
I haven't finished with you yet.

00:35:23.090 --> 00:35:25.230
You have to be there, aren't you?

00:35:25.960 --> 00:35:27.820
I don't want anything to do with it.

00:35:28.840 --> 00:35:29.920
I can't take the risk.

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:40.390
of being involved but you are involved yes but i'm not seen to be oh listen charles i can't take

00:35:40.390 --> 00:35:46.370
much more of this i've got to stand by him until all this gets sorted out but then mary you're

00:35:46.370 --> 00:35:59.920
my patient i can't won't i can't i'd be struck off darling i'm sorry

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:04.140
So am I. I'm just beginning to realise how little I really mean to you.

00:36:04.180 --> 00:36:04.800
Mary, please.

00:36:04.820 --> 00:36:07.560
A little bit on the side. Convenient. Safe.

00:36:08.510 --> 00:36:09.610
When the going gets rough.

00:36:09.880 --> 00:36:11.500
You've always known the situation.

00:36:12.550 --> 00:36:14.930
It's over, Charles. Finished.

00:36:16.860 --> 00:36:21.390
You just stay away from me, or so help me I'll blow it to every newspaper in the country.

00:36:34.190 --> 00:36:34.390
Listen.

00:37:06.430 --> 00:37:07.900
No visitors again? No.

00:37:09.550 --> 00:37:12.090
My husband isn't very well. I see.

00:37:12.770 --> 00:37:14.570
Still, isn't there anyone else you'd like us to contact?

00:37:14.950 --> 00:37:17.490
No, thank you. When can I go home?

00:37:18.320 --> 00:37:20.240
When the doctors say so. Maybe tomorrow.

00:37:20.830 --> 00:37:22.490
See, I'm worried about my husband.

00:37:22.870 --> 00:37:24.390
I've been here three days already.

00:37:25.500 --> 00:37:26.540
How are you feeling now?

00:37:27.450 --> 00:37:29.570
Apart from these pains, I feel absolutely fine.

00:37:30.220 --> 00:37:32.940
Pains are still there? In your arms and legs?

00:37:33.240 --> 00:37:35.710
Mm, and in my side. Here.

00:37:36.560 --> 00:37:39.200
Oh! I'll get you something for them.

00:37:40.310 --> 00:37:44.080
Sister, if there's nothing broken, I want to go home.

00:37:44.890 --> 00:37:46.590
Give it another day. Enjoy the rest.

00:37:47.300 --> 00:37:48.960
What can happen to your husband in one more day?

00:38:31.560 --> 00:38:32.200
You've come back?

00:38:33.140 --> 00:38:33.500
Yes.

00:38:36.120 --> 00:38:37.040
Are you all right now?

00:38:38.010 --> 00:38:39.460
Yes, I'm all right.

00:38:40.830 --> 00:38:41.230
But you?

00:38:44.690 --> 00:38:45.630
Sorry about Muffin.

00:38:46.770 --> 00:38:48.600
You know they had to put him down.

00:38:51.500 --> 00:38:52.020
Didn't come.

00:38:52.160 --> 00:38:56.480
I wanted to.

00:38:59.200 --> 00:38:59.900
I wanted to.

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:23.970
eggs but she wouldn't let me lucinda she wouldn't let me oh david you have gone but you must you must

00:39:23.970 --> 00:39:24.290
fight

00:39:50.060 --> 00:39:50.520
to me

00:41:49.070 --> 00:41:50.070
David, where are you?

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:03.270
David? David, what are you doing?

00:46:04.670 --> 00:46:05.410
Well, that too.

00:46:32.400 --> 00:46:34.910
Oh, God.

00:47:02.680 --> 00:47:12.680
Dr. Henderson there, please. Oh, no. Do you know where I can get hold of him? Yes, it is urgent. It's very, very urgent. Please, I need help.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:31.120
I knew they should have burned.

00:48:00.760 --> 00:48:03.100
He's mine, Mistress Mary. All mine.

00:48:03.460 --> 00:48:05.740
No! You don't...

00:48:09.970 --> 00:48:11.260
You made this?

00:48:11.620 --> 00:48:12.440
Aye, Mistress.

00:48:14.300 --> 00:48:29.980
And we made this to ascender, and she's going...

00:48:30.030 --> 00:48:30.430
Goodbye!
